<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed four Naga civilians and a sniper killed four Tangkhul Nagas on the Imphal-Ukhrul highway, while suspected militants opened fire on two vehicles in Ukhrul, killing four travelers; a woman farmer was killed and three men wounded in Kangpokpi district, and a Kuki woman was killed, sparking a bandh. In Kashmir the CRPF chief reviewed security, ordered intensified anti-terror operations across the region, and directed district commissioners to set up district-level social media cells after two SPOs were killed in Kishtwar. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOSWVRd2lDQWxxLTNxeU5vRUEzOTZQZHRTdm1qMXVuZzY5bVY0Y0lST2U1akhGLWFvZUpXT0ZJelVSSHJUdHlVbVBTakxyTFpDVDlXYXFTTWhxckk1SG9nSHNNbHE3eGo1aEZSZ2hIdTUwRTMzVjJZcUJGTklOck5DZnJsdndrVnI4QXh1bEIwM2d3a044ZVM5ZGRiRGJ5WnJFUlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Highland Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQRlIwNllUX2ZPNlhyTkEtUmcxUG00TXpmQlRvd3VHXy1rMzdqUlFSUEJidkRuaFhra0VUM3YwSGVRV21BQ0ZncEhCc09yUG9PLXNrckxvU294a0NzSXF0UkdzQ2FuTWZHa3lmenlfcnNpME1SX1A1Y1FzTUc1cWV2UEpLM01JLU9nemkwc0lxTjJjWnFCZ1VMWA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQaDJ0QU1jR3Y1SmRMMm1hMUt1bVlfSi1icmtlV1pMRmI1LWVuSkZNYTBRMGZKV3JqakhyWEUyekZjV2EzTzBYdk5XYi1JdGVQdlpTV1MzZ1kxdzd0M01mUlk1Z21PN2E0aVlteE5nZFZ2Vi1FV3dlWFRPX2JJZGRHVnhEV25vWE5za2pKZmFkUkRuaUpCNGhncEk2SXIzeG5ib0dJQkt5Sm1PR2RoV3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPc1NYU0JSSFJ6aV9FOUFpTXl1bGlKX2VfekdPbVNDalVUN2t1cl